   "Pointing Bullish: NEAR's share of fees is 33% over the last 30 days and revenue has risen over each of the last three months. Pointing Bearish: solvers keep a lot or a small group of them dominates (spread 59.9 bps, top 3 hold 80%). In between: one integrator brings much of the fees but stays under the 80% line (SwapKit 75% of visible app fees). The DefiLlama figures come from a dataset nobody can re-run for free.",
